 &lt;BR&gt; 
3. The above Consolidated Financial Results are extracted from the audited consolidated financial statements, which are prepared in accordance with Indian Accounting Standard 34 IND AS, as prescribed under section 133 of the Companies Act, 2013 and in terms of Regulation 33 of the SEBI Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements Regulations, 2015 SEBI Regulations. &lt;BR&gt; 
 &lt;BR&gt; 
